      "solution": "x^{\\frac{1}{3}}(x^{-\\frac{1}{3}} + 2x - x^{\\frac{2}{3}}) = x^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\times x^{-\\frac{1}{3}} + x^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\times 2x - x^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\times x^{\\frac{2}{3}} = x^0 + 2x^{\\frac{4}{3}} - x^1 = 1 + 2x^{\\frac{4}{3}} - x",
